WEBVTT

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.020
Good morning!

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.020
Hey, did you see it?

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.180
You're talking about the show
on TV yesterday, right?

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.700
Hey! 'Morning, Kyoko.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.930
Oh, morning!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.040
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:50.210
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:15.670
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:22.010
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:28.350
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:34.860
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:41.360
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.370
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:54.360
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.290
"Love Cat"

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:34.350
You do realize why you were
summoned here, don't you?

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.350
Huh?

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:38.680
Where did you run off to without telling
your comrades, and for what purpose?

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.350
Shut up! Where and when I go
are none of your business!

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.020
I see...

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:47.030
But that is not so...

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.520
...among us, comrades.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.270
Creed, how is your wound?

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:05.640
Creed, I went to fight... with the man
who you said you wanted as our comrade.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:09.310
Oh? With Train?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:12.650
And you lost miserably, right?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.660
You're no match for Train.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:19.990
What!?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:25.330
He's the one man I truly respect...

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:29.000
and a valuable comrade who will someday
lead the Apostles of the Stars.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.370
Ha! Just what's so special
about that damn cat!?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.010
Is there anything else you wish to say?

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:39.680
I won't be as careless next time.

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.670
I'll tear him into shreds, and...

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.980
This conversation is over.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.630
Oh dear... he's gone and done it.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:04.970
Creed... Was it necessary to kill him?

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.970
You have a problem with that, Charden?

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.310
Well,

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:14.310
I do think that his words
and actions were misguided...

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.980
However, to execute our comrade
with so little thought...

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.210
He deserved to die.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.660
He overestimated his abilities.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.630
And you know what happens
when one does that, don't you?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.660
That's how it is, Charden.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:36.340
He had ceased to be our comrade.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:43.010
He acted on his own
and confronted Train, only to lose.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.980
Yes... he was trash.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:07.100
Our goal is to free the world from
the iron grip of the Chronos Elders,

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.070
and create a better world.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:15.310
To Creed, are we just
tools to achieve that goal...

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:18.870
or perhaps I should say, just spare parts?

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.310
What do you think?

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:25.980
Hmm... He can be a
little shy at times, and...

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:28.320
I have a feeling that he's a late bloomer.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.320
But, even those parts, I...

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.380
Of course, I'm talking about Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.670
Oh!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.000
Is something the matter?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.000
I saw it for the first time...
your face without glasses!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.340
Huh?

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.670
You're so handsome!!

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:50.010
Turn this way, please!

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:52.340
H- hey... Kyoko-<i>san.</i>

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:55.010
I'm talking about a serious matter here...

00:05:55.010 --> 00:06:00.480
Too bad! If it wasn't for Kuro-<i>sama,</i>
I might have fallen for you!

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:02.950
Kuro-<i>sama</i>, huh?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:08.290
Kyoko-<i>san</i>... As things stand now,
in order to achieve our goal,

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.630
we may end up fighting against Black Cat.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:14.300
What!? I can't do that!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:19.970
I agree... It's foolish to fight
someone you love.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:22.910
Hmm... What should I do?

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.000
Caught a cold?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.330
Nah...

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.000
So even you catch colds, Train.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.000
You just insulted me, didn't you?

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.340
Not really.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.340
I'm in such a bind.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:03.950
I think you should do
what you believe is right.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.940
What I believe is right?

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.960
Are you really sure about this, Kyoko-<i>san</i>?

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:16.960
You don't need to become
a traitor, too, you know.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.630
But if I remain an Apostle of the Stars,

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.970
it looks like I'll have to fight Kuro-<i>sama...</i>

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:27.410
And, I'd feel bad if you were
all on your own, Charden-<i>san...</i>

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.980
You really are a strange girl.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.310
Really?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:41.580
You're the one who told me to do
what I believed was right, Charden-<i>san.</i>

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:47.660
All right, then. In any case,
I will take you to town.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:50.330
Then we'll part for now.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:53.670
After I think this over a little,
I'll contact you again.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.670
Okay!

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.160
I don't know what will happen from now.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.940
Please be very careful.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.940
Okay! I'll be fine!

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:09.280
I know! When I get home, I'm gonna
pay a visit to Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.620
If I show up out of nowhere
and give him a kiss,

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:14.620
I wonder if Kuro-<i>sama</i> will be happy!?

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:17.960
--How embarrassing!
--U- uhm, Kyoko-<i>san,</i>

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:22.960
you should keep
such fantasies to yourself.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.960
Oh? Was I thinking out loud?

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.590
Yes, very much so.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:35.640
What!? Charden and Kyoko did?

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:41.310
They're hopeless if they
cannot follow our ideals.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.650
What should we do?

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:47.320
I'll go. I doubt if they've gone far yet.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.650
What do you want to do?

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:52.320
I'm free, so I don't mind going along.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.760
Well then, let's go have some fun.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.600
What's that?

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:06.270
A special bullet with nanomachines in it...

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.000
though it's still experimental.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:17.620
Shinkitou, which activates Tao powers,
is essential to the Apostles of the Stars.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:21.620
However, since each individual
reacts to it differently,

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.620
the success rate is low.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.630
So I wondered if I'd be able to invent
something that can replace it,

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:30.960
and as a trial I created this... Lucifer...

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.300
Lucifer?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:37.400
When a person is shot with this,
his body will transform without fail.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:43.640
However, since genes
are rearranged randomly,

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.310
there's no telling what kind
of transformation will occur.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.980
Wow, that's interesting!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:52.650
Then, let's try it on the girl first.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.990
Kyoko Kirisaki, huh?

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.280
All right.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:04.330
Now, come to me...

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.330
Kyoko Kirisaki!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:10.340
You've got some nerve
not paying attention in my class!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.670
Why thank you.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.670
Quit daydreaming!

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.010
Come to the teachers' office after school!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.410
Okay!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.020
Just what is the matter with you?

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.690
Your grades have been
going down steadily.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.360
Yes, that's true.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.690
And, you have too many
unexcused absences!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.190
You recently missed one week of school!
Where did you go?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.030
Well...

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:46.710
I do understand that you get lonely being
all alone since your parents work abroad.

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:50.710
I'm worried about you, you know.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.540
The world is a dangerous place lately,

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.380
and incidents have been
occurring everywhere.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.920
When I think that something
might happen to you

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.750
while you were absent from school, I...

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.650
I...

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.050
Oh...

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.760
She's gone...

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.330
Hey, Kyoko. Just what where you doing
when you were absent from school?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.000
Well... this and that.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.670
Don't tell me you were
at some guy's house!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:16.670
Oh, no way!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.230
Kyoko prefers candies to guys!

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:26.680
Come to think of it,
it's almost Heart Gift Day!

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:30.020
Oh... is it that time already?

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.350
Who should I give my heart to this year?

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:35.020
<i>Oh yeah...</i>

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.020
<i>That's right!</i>

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:41.020
<i>All I have to do is express my feeling</i>
<i>to Kuro-sama with chocolates!</i>

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.310
Oh sorry!

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.650
You did that on purpose, didn't you!?

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:06.990
Shut up! It's already done! What can I do?

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.320
I'm saying don't spray snot my way!

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.990
You just happened to be
in the way of my snot!

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:10.990
What'd you say!?

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.320
Gossiping...

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.660
Huh?

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:18.330
Someone who begrudges you
is gossiping about you, Train.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:22.000
And bad luck will soon come your way...

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.000
Bad luck?

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.470
Yes, bad luck...

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:38.750
Lala, Kuro-<i>sama</i>, yay!

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:45.260
All right! I just have to refrigerate this
so that it'll harden and... it'll be done!

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:52.720
Once he eats this, I bet
Kuro-<i>sama</i> will be very happy!

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.370
Thank you, Kyoko...

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:02.310
Aahhh! Oh, stop that, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:07.310
Please let me meet
with Kuro-<i>sama</i> tomorrow...

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:09.310
All right!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.110
Good night, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.990
Hey Sven...

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:23.260
Huh?

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.330
I'm hungry...

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.060
You ate breakfast already, you know.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.340
Huh!? That was one measly cup noodle!

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:37.010
Besides, it's evening already!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:40.680
If you have any complaints,
go find some work for a change.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:44.350
Okay, fine! I'll get us a big-paying job!

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.680
I'm coming, too.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.690
Oh? You coming, too, princess?

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:50.020
Okay, then! Let's find a big fish together!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:52.720
I'll find a bigger fish than you.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.700
Done!

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:00.300
It's done! It's done!

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:05.430
Let me see... First, I must
go where sweepers gather.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:13.310
Hhmm... Let's see,
which of these looks easy?

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:16.410
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.120
Aahh!!

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.380
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:32.000
Argh!

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.520
At last we meet!

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.020
Huh!?

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.020
A cat again!

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.360
If I remember right,
you're one of the Apostles of the Stars...

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.360
Right!

00:14:58.360 --> 00:15:02.290
But I quit the Apostles of the Stars!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.630
Huh? Quit?

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:09.300
It's just... I don't want
to fight you, Kuro-<i>sama,</i>

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:14.330
--and so, and so...
--Train, I don't think she's lying.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.640
You really quit?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.980
Yes!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:24.980
Never mind that, I have
something I want to give you today.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:27.650
What do you think it is!?

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.990
Tad!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.660
Hey, girlie...

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:35.660
--Aren't you even gonna apologize?
--You're hurting me. Please let me go!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.960
Here!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.330
Don't act so cocky!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:47.860
It's a big mistake if you think
an apology would cut it.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.340
I won't forgive you!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.010
I went to all that trouble...

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:58.880
to make it, 'cause...
I wanted Kuro-<i>sama</i> to eat it!!

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:11.790
Train Kick!

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:16.730
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.650
You're no longer one of them, right?

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:35.990
Uhm, no.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:39.480
Then, don't use those powers ever again.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.130
Kuro-<i>sama...</i>

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.130
Okay, I got it!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.010
Hey, this is pretty good.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.680
Wanna try some, too, princess?

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.680
No thanks.

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:02.040
Well, it's a bit spicy.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.320
Why you! How dare you!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:18.300
Argh! It's hot!!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:21.360
I wonder if I added too much
habanero pepper?

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:25.300
W- water! Water! Water!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.930
Water!!

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:49.330
So they've come in pursuit.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.920
Please be careful, Kyoko-<i>san.</i>

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.280
Ow, ow...

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:08.610
Kyoko Kirisaki.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:09.910
Yes!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.550
Doctor-<i>san...</i>

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.840
What!?

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:54.120
Oh dear... If it isn't Black Cat...

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:58.330
Ha! Now this is a
very interesting development.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.660
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:02.860
You bastard! What the hell
do you think you're doing!?

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:07.610
Looks like we've been interrupted...

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:11.200
I'll come back to properly
introduce myself, Black Cat.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:17.620
I look forward to seeing
your appearance when next we meet.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.950
What?

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.510
Leon, we're leaving.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:46.980
Kuro-<i>sama</i>! Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.310
I'm so sorry!! I...

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:52.440
Don't worry, it's just a scratch.

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:54.320
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:55.650
Ouch! Arghh!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.490
The wound'll open!!

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.690
So, the bad luck was really...

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:22.680
What's wrong? The food's getting cold.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.020
Huh?

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.350
Aren't you going to eat?

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:27.020
It's not that I won't eat.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:29.020
I <i>can't</i> eat!

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.690
Of all food, why does it have
to be super-spicy noodles!?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.090
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:39.130
H- hey, why're you here!?

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:43.700
She's with the Apostles of the Stars!

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.690
You don't have to worry about her.

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:49.640
That's why I told her
that we're staying here.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.040
You told her!?

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.380
Well... if I didn't tell her,
I thought she'd stalk you.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.720
What!? What do you want!?

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:00.650
I came because I was worried!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.680
I wanted to see if your wound
on your arm was okay.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:09.990
I look forward to seeing
your appearance when next we meet.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:12.050
<i>What did he mean by that?</i>

